### sync-POST Request

# curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/customer -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"customer_name": "Michael Pfeffer", "customer_type": "Company", "email_id": "michael@michael-pfeffer-consulting.com"}'
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/customer-sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Michael Pfeffer",
  "customer_type": "Company",
  "email_id": "michael@michael-pfeffer-consulting.com"
}

